// Chipova Forge's STM32F4 Discovery board for Renode 1.17.0: Renode's own board (STM32F407VG,
// user button on PA0, LEDs on port D), with
//   - the GPIO -> EXTI wiring put back (renode_fixes.repl),
//   - all four user LEDs (Renode models only the green one),
//   - FSMC bank 1 cut to its first 64 MB (NE1): NE2-NE4 (0x64000000-0x6FFFFFFF) are free for
//     chips on the MCU's external bus,
//   - the core clock of a STM32F407 after reset (16 MHz HSI; Renode's default is 72 MHz): the
//     firmware templates don't start the PLL, so SysTick and their delays match a real board.
using "platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery-kit.repl"
using "./renode_fixes.repl"

ledOrange: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpioPortD
ledRed: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpioPortD
ledBlue: Miscellaneous.LED @ gpioPortD

fsmcBank1:
    size: 0x04000000

nvic:
    systickFrequency: 16000000
